1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 18=

5
00:00:09,039 --> 00:00:09,439
Bao'er.

6
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:10,519
Hua.

7
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,800
Look.

8
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:16,120
I finally found an amazing wine.

9
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:17,879
(1982)

10
00:00:17,879 --> 00:00:18,839
This vintage...

11
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,359
It's older than you.

12
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,359
Of course.

13
00:00:22,679 --> 00:00:24,480
You have no idea how long I looked.

14
00:00:27,239 --> 00:00:29,640
I couldn't think of a better way

15
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:31,160
to wish you and Dad

16
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,320
a lifetime of happiness.

17
00:00:33,119 --> 00:00:33,719
Let's have a drink.

18
00:00:35,320 --> 00:00:36,560
How thoughtful of you.

19
00:00:37,079 --> 00:00:37,520
Cheers!

20
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:42,479
Bottoms up!

21
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:44,240
Drink up!

22
00:00:52,600 --> 00:00:53,320
I can't finish it.

23
00:00:58,280 --> 00:00:58,960
You're here.

24
00:01:01,359 --> 00:01:01,799
Hua,

25
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,640
let me formally introduce you.

26
00:01:04,519 --> 00:01:06,640
This is Mr. Wei Fanxing.

27
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:08,439
Handsome, right?

28
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:11,000
Those flirty eyes are so charming.

29
00:01:11,519 --> 00:01:12,519
In our circle,

30
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,920
he's known as the handsome rich boy.

31
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:17,439
And this is Mr. Zeng Ye.

32
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:20,840
Great fighter. Great shot.

33
00:01:21,400 --> 00:01:22,359
And let me tell you,

34
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,319
he may look all handsome,

35
00:01:24,400 --> 00:01:25,879
cool and cocky,

36
00:01:26,280 --> 00:01:27,560
but he's really dependable.

37
00:01:28,159 --> 00:01:29,040
You little rascal.

38
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,400
Enough with the flattery.

39
00:01:32,239 --> 00:01:33,400
Bao'er's told us so much about you.

40
00:01:33,760 --> 00:01:34,359
Today,

41
00:01:34,599 --> 00:01:35,719
we finally get to meet properly.

42
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,000
Nice to meet you.

43
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:39,480
Lovely to meet you both.

44
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,640
Cheers!

45
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,599
Where's my dad?

46
00:01:56,680 --> 00:01:59,200
I saw him taking a call outside.

47
00:01:59,519 --> 00:02:00,640
Very mysterious.

48
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,599
Must be something big.

49
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:04,799
If he has to deal with it himself,

50
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:05,959
it must be serious.

51
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:13,639
Hua!

52
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,319
Big news!

53
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,159
Look.

54
00:02:19,319 --> 00:02:20,719
Li Sirong and Li Siyan were made

55
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,840
to kneel as punishment.

56
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,919
They're in big trouble now.

57
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,120
Those two...

58
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,439
See?

59
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:29,599
That's what happens to bad people.

60
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:32,639
(Was it Xie Zhouhan?)

61
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:36,680
(He's been quietly protecting me
all this time.)

62
00:02:38,199 --> 00:02:39,639
I heard people saying

63
00:02:39,719 --> 00:02:41,560
the Li family's in big trouble.

64
00:02:42,120 --> 00:02:42,919
Could someone be

65
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,840
protecting his wife?

66
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,400
Spoiling her like this...

67
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:48,919
he's making it way too obvious.

68
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:56,639
Excuse me.

69
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,080
I'll step out for a moment.

70
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:59,159
Please keep eating.

71
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,000
You did it, didn't you?

72
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:23,360
What do you mean?

73
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,960
Li Sirong and Li Siyan's punishment.

74
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:27,599
That was you, wasn't it?

75
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:30,240
No one gets to hurt my wife.

76
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:37,960
♪Maybe I'm falling♪

77
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,400
Let's go home.

78
00:03:40,866 --> 00:03:43,099
♪A little too soon♪

79
00:03:43,947 --> 00:03:46,885
♪How do I know♪

80
00:03:47,343 --> 00:03:50,352
♪If your heart is feeling my way♪

81
00:03:51,746 --> 00:03:54,698
♪How do I tell♪

82
00:03:55,142 --> 00:03:58,392
♪If you want me to stay♪

83
00:03:59,538 --> 00:04:03,056
♪When you say my name♪

84
00:04:03,689 --> 00:04:04,824
♪It feels like♪

85
00:04:04,848 --> 00:04:07,202
♪The start of something♪

86
00:04:07,638 --> 00:04:10,793
♪But I'm still afraid♪

87
00:04:11,543 --> 00:04:13,688
♪To call it love♪

88
00:04:13,838 --> 00:04:17,972
♪If this is only almost love♪

89
00:04:18,136 --> 00:04:19,427
♪You left like you know♪

90
00:04:19,451 --> 00:04:20,961
♪I remember♪

91
00:04:22,283 --> 00:04:24,593
♪Every word you didn't say♪

92
00:04:26,425 --> 00:04:29,280
♪There's a shadow of a promise♪

93
00:04:29,785 --> 00:04:32,607
♪In the way you look away♪

94
00:04:41,759 --> 00:04:42,680
(I drank too much last night.)

95
00:04:42,759 --> 00:04:43,600
(I wasn't thinking straight.)

96
00:04:44,360 --> 00:04:46,319
(I got carried away
and lost all restraint.)

97
00:04:47,160 --> 00:04:48,560
(I actually made the first move...)

98
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:15,800
Um...

99
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,519
I drank too much last night.

100
00:05:20,600 --> 00:05:21,879
I didn't mean to.

101
00:05:25,560 --> 00:05:28,160
I loved you taking charge last night.

102
00:05:29,240 --> 00:05:29,879
Very brave.

103
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:35,880
(Mrs. Wen)

104
00:05:42,279 --> 00:05:43,360
Hello, Mrs. Wen?

105
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:45,839
Hua, are you free this afternoon?

106
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:48,199
I've set you up on a blind date.

107
00:05:48,399 --> 00:05:50,360
He's from a good family. A good man.

108
00:05:50,879 --> 00:05:51,759
Just meet him once.

109
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,040
You have to go.

110
00:05:53,439 --> 00:05:55,120
I'd be so embarrassed if you didn't.

111
00:05:55,759 --> 00:05:57,040
Mrs. Wen, I just...

112
00:05:57,480 --> 00:05:58,160
I'd rather not...

113
00:05:58,360 --> 00:06:00,079
Think of it as having lunch with me.

114
00:06:00,439 --> 00:06:01,720
Mr. Gu agrees, too.

115
00:06:01,920 --> 00:06:02,680
No excuses.

116
00:06:02,839 --> 00:06:03,399
I...

117
00:06:03,399 --> 00:06:04,839
Come on. No more hesitation.

118
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,879
I'll send you his details

119
00:06:06,959 --> 00:06:07,519
right now.

120
00:06:13,920 --> 00:06:14,759
Mrs. Xie,

121
00:06:15,360 --> 00:06:17,560
you've barely left your husband's bed,

122
00:06:18,439 --> 00:06:19,959
and you're going on a blind date
with another man?

123
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,240
♪You say you♪

124
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,120
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

125
00:06:39,440 --> 00:06:42,520
♪You're just fine on your own♪

126
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:45,680
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

127
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:48,680
♪And the pain you face at night♪

128
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:52,360
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

129
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:55,560
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

130
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:58,640
♪Some love needs no promises♪

131
00:06:58,640 --> 00:07:02,000
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

132
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,680
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

133
00:07:04,680 --> 00:07:08,000
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

134
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:10,840
♪I'm right behind you♪

135
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:14,400
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

136
00:07:14,400 --> 00:07:17,040
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

137
00:07:17,040 --> 00:07:21,000
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

138
00:07:23,880 --> 00:07:27,320
♪I'm right behind you♪

139
00:07:27,320 --> 00:07:29,120
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

140
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:30,960
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

141
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:33,520
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

142
00:07:33,520 --> 00:07:34,960
♪I'm right behind you♪

143
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:37,320
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

144
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:39,080
♪I won't claim you♪

145
00:07:39,080 --> 00:07:40,760
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

146
00:07:40,760 --> 00:07:43,400
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

147
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:46,760
♪Waiting for you♪
